docs/training_modes.md:36:| `deployment.num_teacher_gpus` | `None` | Number of GPUs for the teacher vLLM server. Auto-starts when set. OPD only. |
docs/training_modes.md:37:| `trainer.loss.teacher_tau` | `0.0` | Distillation strength. Must be `> 0` in OPD. |
